{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>\n\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0824/1d27ebf708c6e92.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>評論區網友紛紛點讚，稱這是理工男的浪漫。</p>\n<p>據悉，玄戒O3採用先進的3nm工藝製程，晶片面積僅133平方毫米，電晶體數量增至240億，相比上一代O1提升26%。</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0824/614ccc0192d02d9.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/0824/1d27ebf708c6e92.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-24T08:58:34.854569+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":79,"images":3,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"none"}}